Proposition 5.3. [D]

Let T_{\text{acq}} be the acquisition window, T_{\text{sleep}} the sleep interval, P_{\text{acq}} and P_{\text{sleep}} the corresponding powers, and P_{\text{cmp}} the always-on comparator power. The duty cycle is

